  "description": "Introducing the next big thing in big wheel BMX – the Hooligan® series. Whether you're a heritage BMXer or a young ripper on a rideout, you’ll be right at home on Hooligan. Available with either steel or aluminum frames, the Hooligan features 29\" wheels and modern geometry for the perfect fusion of stoke and comfort.\nBig 29\" wheels for modern BMX comfort and geometry with vintage pad set and graphics for an old school look and feel. Suggested rider height 5'4\" - 6'2\"\nDurable hi-ten steel frame (23.7\" top tube length) with threadless steel fork are ready to hit the streets\nSingle-speed drivetrain with tubular chromoly three-piece crank offers performance while keeping things simple\nDurable, lightweight aluminum rims with rear mechanical disc brake for all-weather stopping power and speed control",
